dering the completion message.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:01-define-button-chain-page goal-size-exception -p '\\\"'10.1:' \\\\\\\"Not applicable. This goal owns four work units, within the 2 to 10 work-unit limit.\\\\\\\"\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior current-state-and-prior-goal-handoffs -p '\\\"'2.1:' \\\\\\\"This goal depends on goal 01 handing off a complete future button-chain.html implementation target.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior why-this-goal-is-needed -p '\\\"'4.1:' \\\\\\\"The requested behavior is interactive, so readiness requires both a repeatable regression check and a real user-click browser story.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior scope -p '\\\"'5.1:' \\\\\\\"In scope are the planned DOM regression target and the US-01 browser flow. Out of scope is changing implementation behavior during verification steps.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior affected-areas -p '\\\"'6.1:' \\\\\\\"Affected proof targets are button-chain.html for the planned DOM regression and the bounded browser flow named in W06.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior dependencies-and-handoffs -p '\\\"'7.1:' \\\\\\\"W05 depends on W01 through W04. W06 depends on W01 through W05 and hands off recorded browser evidence, story status, and any bug-register updates.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$u\\\" section \\\"$PLAN_DIR\\\" goal:02-prove-button-chain-behavior implementation-approach-risks-and-edge-cases -p '\\\"'8.1:' \\\\\\\"The proof must fail if an earlier generated button appends, if a click appends more than one button, if the fourth generated button does not clear the document, if text differs from finished, or if the border is not visibly white.\\\\\\\" \\n\\\\\\\"\